{"excerpt_id":"ex_51d3108c7446_036","source_id":"src_51d3108c7446","source_hash":"dc719d571a57b87c66595375f3bd4ce41ea387f1711e558ec86ba4ccd8e39672","text":"taker_gets String or Object The amount the account accepting the offer receives, as a String representing an amount in XRP, or a currency specification object. (See Specifying Currency Amounts )","location_hint":"paragraph 142","char_start":5851,"char_end":6045,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:26:19.711Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_51d3108c7446_037","source_id":"src_51d3108c7446","source_hash":"dc719d571a57b87c66595375f3bd4ce41ea387f1711e558ec86ba4ccd8e39672","text":"taker_pays String or Object The amount the account accepting the offer provides, as a String representing an amount in XRP, or a currency specification object. (See Specifying Currency Amounts )","location_hint":"paragraph 143","char_start":6047,"char_end":6241,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:26:19.711Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_51d3108c7446_038","source_id":"src_51d3108c7446","source_hash":"dc719d571a57b87c66595375f3bd4ce41ea387f1711e558ec86ba4ccd8e39672","text":"quality String The exchange rate of the offer, as the ratio of the original taker_pays divided by the original taker_gets . When executing offers, the offer with the most favorable (lowest) quality is consumed first; offers with the same quality are executed from oldest to newest.","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":6243,"char_end":6524,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:26:19.711Z"}
